 on the  level of the user this hardening can  still be overcome by pure physical  strength or by another user with  stronger willpower  now while observation and armament haki  exist in every living thing there's a  third kind of haki that only a very  exclusive group of people have access to  conquerors or how Shoku haki can only be  awakened by those who have the will of a  conqueror it uses the strong will of the  user to directly influence the weaker  wills of others we have so far seen the  submission of will  in the form of taming intimidation as  well as knocking others unconscious it  is still mysterious though what the true  power of Congress hockey is and what  makes it so unique now as a consequence  the introduction of these three types of  willpower into the fighting system has  changed the power distribution in the  warm peace world significantly from our  perspective before hockey if you ate and  acquired the power of a devil fruit it  gave the person a clear advantage over  normal people  after the time-skip though we learned  that hockey can be used to actively  counter devil fruit users this allowed  people without a power to compete at the  top level as well in a way hockey has  led to a shift from supernatural power  to individual skill and training when it  comes to fights on a very high level you  could even argue that especially in the  New World  having strong hockey might actually be  way more important than owning a devil  fruit power still there is a lot we do  not know about the concept of hockey  while we now know a lot about  observation haki conquers hockey remains  mostly mystery but we recently learned a  little more about the functioning of  armament haki from yukimaru he explained  to us that sorrow sword shoots we turned  black over a certain period of time in  the hands of Reema the hero of guano and  it seems to be very likely that this is  connected to the use of hockey but how  exactly does this infusion of objects  with hockey work in the first place and  how could it be connected to the  creation of the poni glyphs infusing an  object with armament haki basically  refers to transferring and manifesting  one's willpower onto its surface so far  we have only seen three different types  of hockey and fusion in the story the  first and most common use of armament is  to coat parts of the users own body or  anything in contact with it this seems  to be the most basic form of hockey in  fusion that has to be achieved by anyone  who wants to call themselves a true  armament user the coding of willpower  hardens the skin and gives it increased  attack and defense in terms of physical  combat additionally it also serves as a  weapon against delaford users since the  use of hockey is able to nullify a devil  fruits power now this effect can also be  extended to any object that is in  contact with the body since it allows a  direct flow of willpower we most  commonly see this happening with swords  or clothing but what does this actually  do so for instance when sorrow coats has  soared into hockey it increases the  level of hardness significantly make  it's stronger and less likely to break  once he loses hold of his weapons though  the flow of hockey stops and the Blake  goes back to normal and this brings us  to the second type of use in fusing  armament into objects for a short amount  of time without actually keeping direct  contact now as we just saw with the  example of Zorro usually the flow of  hockey stops when object loses contact  with the user's body yet we have  actually seen an example where this was  not the case when luffy was sent to  amazon lille by kuma the Kuja tribe of  the island actually had the ability to  infuse the arrows with hockey which made  them ridiculously strong and effective  while this is the only case where we  have seen this ability officially in the  story so far  it proves that hockey can be stored  inside an object for a certain amount of  time even without keeping contact to  achieve this I believe special training  will be required and I would not be  surprised to be introduced to variations  of this like hockey infuse bullets in  the near future in the story  why else for instance what Keys aru be  threatened by Ben Backman pointed gun at  him but that is another question now the  real question here is whether objects  can also be infused with hockey over a  longer amount of time which brings us to  the third type of armament use permanent  hockey in fusion and this also brings us  back to our good friend yukimaru who  suggested to us that shoe sweet turned  into a black blade over time a frequent  use through a mighty swordsman if this  actually ties back to repeated infusion  of a blade with hockey that will mean  that it is possible to permanently store  your willpower in an object where in  other words making it permanently coated  in armament and while we have only seen  this technique being used with weapons  so far I do not see any reason why this  should not be possible with any other  object as well so let's think are there  any other objects in the one-piece world  that seem to display these distinct  traits of hockey in fusion and the  answer to this unnecessarily dramatic  rhetorical question is yes poni glyphs  actually seem to fit perfectly into this  category so let's take a look at what  poni glyphs actually are and why they  might be hockey made 800 years ago in  one Oh a clan of master stonemasons  known as the Kisuke family created  indestructible stone blocks that  recorded important historical events  from the white century these stone  blocks would become known as the pony  glyphs physically Pony lists are massive  cube shaped rocks made of an apparently  indestructible  stone that carry ancient text on their  surface the creators that Kazuki family  passed on the knowledge of how to read  and write these ancient letters within  their family up until Kazuki Odom due to  his execution though he couldn't pass on  his knowledge making robbing the  survival of Ahura the last person in the  world capable of deciphering these  ancient symbols in total there are three  types of Kona glyphs scattered across  the world historical Pony glyphs  instructional Pony glyphs and wrote Pony  glyphs historical Pony glyphs contain  pieces of ancient history during the  void century instructional Pony glyphs  contain information about the location  of these historical Pony glyphs and  finally the four road Pony lives  together detail the location of rough  tell the final island of the grand line  that contains the legendary one piece  now I think that it's fair to say that  the pony lives are of incredible  importance they carry the secret of the  ancient kingdom and the void century  through the ages without the world  government being able to destroy them  what then made these blocks of stone  survived for over 900 years unscratched  was it the material they were made out  of and then how in the world whether  Kisuke able to write on them a much  likely answer is that the Pony glyphs  are actually haki infused objects let's  look at the arguments for this the first  and most obvious clue we have is the  indestructibility and agelessness of the  pony glyphs just like the black blades  we talked about earlier they appear to  be unbreakable  also similar like a black blade would  never rusts the rock that they are made  out of never shows any sign of erosion  or cracking they're simply perfect cubes  preserved in time having them  permanently coated in hockey would  definitely explain this phenomenon the  second argument is the existence of  devil fruits now I would argue that it  is 100% certain that more than one  person at some point in time tried to  destroy opponent lifts with his devil  fruit power and we have seen the  destructive power of some of these  fruits if you imagine someone wielding a  power like white clears guru guru Nomi  it seems highly unlikely that 